# 1. Format and lint only staged files.
#    `vp fmt` rewrites staged files in place; `vp lint --fix` applies safe
#    fixes (Vite+ wraps Oxfmt/Oxlint, so there are no standalone binaries to
#    call). If anything unfixable remains, the lint exits non-zero and the
#    commit is blocked. lint-staged re-stages the fixed files.
pnpm lint-staged

# 2. Type-check the whole project.
#    TypeScript has no concept of "staged files" — cross-file type inference
#    requires the full source tree to be valid.
pnpm run typecheck
